    <section class="settings-card"><h2>One editorial release</h2><p>Keep the article as the full account. Adapt the social hook, image or video for each channel, and use the newsletter to explain why this week matters.</p><p><a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/edit/'.$post['id'])?>">Edit article</a> <a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/publishing/new?post='.$post['id'])?>">Prepare social versions</a> <a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/newsletter/new?post='.$post['id'])?>">Draft newsletter</a></p><p class="muted">The links below identify the article and channel. They do not identify readers. Email confirmations in Newsletter are the source of truth for subscriptions; Analytics is consent dependent.</p><a href="<?=url('/write/discovery')?>">Review search discovery and reporting →</a></section>
